      "deviations_from_vendor_code": [
        "Sessions arrive through the shim as one put_page per session (the capture-hook path), not through gbrain's transcript import adapters; the page shape follows gbrain's transcript renderer (type: conversation, date, imessage-slack anchor lines) without its 4,000-character per-message cap or part splitting, so no turn text is cut.",
        "The update check and autopilot install are not reachable from the sandbox; apply-migrations runs with --no-autopilot-install."
      ],
